  "body": "## Fix\n* edc7a42 fix: detect the New Tab page in fullscreen for `new_tab_disable` by @Bush2021\n\n    > **Resolves #299** - With `open_bookmark_new_tab` and `new_tab_disable` both on, clicking a bookmark from a New Tab page in fullscreen (F11) now opens it in that tab, the same as in a normal window. Before this fix, bookmarks clicked in fullscreen always opened in a new tab.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Bush2021/chrome_plus/compare/1.20.0...1.20.1\n",
